 or revoked API key or access token. `code: token_issuer_lost_access` means the member who created the API key was deactivated or lost access to the workspace: ask a workspace admin for a new key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"The credentials are valid but cannot be used here. `code: permission_denied`: the workspace role behind the API key or OAuth sign-in lacks `redreplier.write`; `role`, `keyRole` and `issuerRole` say which role fell short. `code: subscription_required`: the organization plan does not include API access. `code: workspace_access_denied`: `X-Workspace-Id` names a workspace the caller cannot reach, or an API key was sent to a workspace other than its own","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}},"parameters":[{"name":"X-Workspace-Id","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"The workspace to act in, for OAuth sign-ins that reach several workspaces. Take the id from `GET /workspaces`. Without it the call lands in the default workspace. A workspace the caller cannot reach answers 403 with `code: workspace_access_denied`. An API key belongs to one workspace: send its own id or leave the header out"}]},"put":{"operationId":"updateAlertSettings","summary":"Turn email alerts on or off and set the cadence","description":"A cadence faster than the plan allows is clamped to the plan floor.","tags":["Alerts"],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UpdateAlertSettingsRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Alert settings","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AlertSettings"}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}